IDD_NET_AUTH DIALOG 0, 0, SETUP_SMALL_DIALOG_DIMS STYLE DS_MODALFRAME | DS_CENTER | DS_SHELLFONT | WS_POPUP | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU CAPTION "Serverautentisering krävs" FONT 8, "MS Shell Dlg"
