IDD_CHOOSE DIALOG 0, 0, SETUP_STANDARD_DIALOG_DIMS STYLE DS_MODALFRAME | DS_CENTER | DS_SHELLFONT | WS_CHILD | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU CAPTION "Cygwin-installation - Välj paket" FONT 8, "MS Shell Dlg"
