    EDITTEXT        IDC_CONFIRM_EDIT,7,41,325,131,WS_VSCROLL | WS_HSCROLL | ES_LEFT | ES_MULTILINE | ES_READONLY | ES_AUTOHSCROLL | ES_AUTOVSCROLL
